        "summary": "Record the eligible authenticated recipient's first read observation",
        "description": "No body or {}. Cannot select observer/status/time. Requires current interaction permission. First observation and recording times are durable; identical retries return them. New observations on tombstones are refused; an existing observation can be returned idempotently. This endpoint does not manufacture delivery acknowledgements.",
